@startuml C3_Resource_Usage_Physical_View
title C3 – Resource Usage (Physical / Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "User Device" as Device {
  artifact "Angular SPA" as Spa
}

node "PLMS Backend" as Backend {
  artifact ".NET TodoApi" as TodoApi
}

node "OEM Platform" as Platform {
  artifact "OEM API Pod" as OemApi
  artifact "Aggregation Worker" as Worker
  database "Operation Plans DB" as PlansDb
  database "Resource Analytics Cache" as CacheDb
}

node "IAM Cluster" as Identity {
  artifact "OIDC Provider" as Idp
}

Operator --> Spa : HTTPS
Spa --> TodoApi : REST (resource usage)
TodoApi --> OemApi : HTTPS
OemApi --> Worker : Delegate heavy aggregation
Worker --> PlansDb : Read saved plans
Worker --> CacheDb : Store cached totals
OemApi --> TodoApi : Aggregated response
TodoApi --> Spa : Summary JSON
TodoApi --> Idp : Token validation (per session)
Spa --> Idp : Login/OAuth redirect

@enduml
